### Probar el endpoint /ouija/ask
POST http://localhost:3001/ouija/ask
Content-Type: application/json
X-Session-Id: test-user-rest-client

{
  "question": "¿Funcionará esta extensión?",
  "language": "es"
}

### Otra prueba (personalidad cryptic)
POST http://localhost:3001/ouija/ask
Content-Type: application/json
